OpenColorIO
-----------
../ocio.rs re-implements the allocation and LUT interpolation of OpenColorIO 2.5.0 (the version
bundled with Blender 5.2.2), following the source of AcademySoftwareFoundation/OpenColorIO v2.5.0.
That source is licensed under BSD-3-Clause, Copyright Contributors to the OpenColorIO Project
(for example, the SPDX header of src/OpenColorIO/ops/allocation/AllocationOp.cpp).
